+// The party's tasks as both players see them (CampaignEvent 11): every party
+// task's id, state (0 failed, 1 in progress, 2 completed), the pooled count
+// and the need, its title, description, icon and map location as the
+// server's native task holds them. Sent when any of it changes and to a
+// client entering the world; a finished task once more with its final state.
